      "content": "it just feels so heavy. like i'm carrying this weight every single day but i can't even feel the weight, just the emptiness. there's no point in trying to \"be true to myself\" if there's nothing actually there anymore. it's just a void. i'm just so tired of performing. i'm tired of pretending to be okay when everything feels so dead inside.",
